          "docs": "Receive Status of Unified Patent Court data by patent_id or patent_number.This data includes Opt-out not registered,Opt-out registered,,Withdrawal after opt-out,Positive decision after unitary effect request. For more details please view the full list of fields in the developer document."
        },
